<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Sanluis earnings seen down.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sanluis earnings seen down.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut its estimate on Sanluis Corporacion earnings per ADS from $3.90 to $3.86, and its estimate on EBITDA per ADS from $5.10 to $4.84, after meeting with senior management.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Despite moderate growth in gold and silver volumes and increased sales in autoparts, precious metal prices in the world market continued to be soft,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
</text>
